%@!?!!!!

Sonja.  Barbarian.  Level 16.  166 Hp.  AC -10: speed boots, cloak
of magic resistance. blessed rustproof +2 Cleaver. Two blessed luckstones.
Bag of holding full of identified gems.  My first horn of plenty EVER.
Magic markers and holy water galore.  Did I mention amulet of reflection?

I was strutting around eating wraith corpses . . . I saw a fountain, I
said, hey, I'll drink from it, I can take whatever shit it throws at me.
It says, "This water's no good!"  Suddenly, I'm stressed, despite 18/11
strength.  I check out my inventory.  Random things are cursed . . .
including my bag of holding!  AGGG!  So, I frantically try to take all
the good stuff out -- I didn't care if a few odd wands died, I just wanted
my holy water and luckstones. 

If this weren't bad enough . . . I get the dreaded
"Segmentation fault."  Friggin' 3.1 version, I hate it..
No more Sonja, a very promising character.  Goddammit, I'm never drinking
from a fountain again.  I'd rather identify juice potions than risk this
bullshit again.  Didn't even make it to the scoreboard.

BTW, all the dev team people lurking on this newsgroup, own up, dammit.
We know you're out there.  The executive producer of babylon 5 is a
regular poster to alt.tv.babylon-5, so why don't you guys don't come out
of the closet??  (Gee, maybe because they'd start getting e-mail death
threats!!)
